  <section class="guide-section" aria-labelledby="guide-map-title">
    <p class="panel-step">01 · THE PATH</p><h2 id="guide-map-title">One image at a time, on a single PC</h2>
    <p class="guide-lede">The image PC has a single graphics card, shared with the language models. To draw, AgentX borrows the card from them, computes the image, keeps the original, then gives the card back in the state it found it.</p>
