          <desc id="guide-map-desc">Three ways to request an image lead to AgentX Core. Core borrows the graphics card from the language models, sends the work to the image PC’s keeper, which starts ComfyUI for the time of one image, keeps the original in the archive, then serves the image to whoever requested it.</desc>
